    "description_raw": "This spell allows you to gain the benefits of a freedom of movement spell and a +4 bonus on saving throws against fear effects. The spell also makes you drunk.\n\nFor the duration of the spell, you take a –2 penalty on attack rolls, ability checks, skill checks, and concentration checks. If you somehow remove or avoid these penalties, the spell’s duration ends.\n\nGet this book AND\nSupport this site!",
